WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:00.911
Meet Sally.

2
00:00:00.911 --> 00:00:09.706
She sells home and hardware products online, and she has grown her site one step at a time with the Accelerator from Strategic Machines.

3
00:00:09.706 --> 00:00:11.193
She doesn't write code.

4
00:00:11.193 --> 00:00:12.616
She knows how to sell.

5
00:00:13.016 --> 00:00:18.189
Today's step: let shoppers pick a product, pay with Stripe, and have it shipped.

6
00:00:18.189 --> 00:00:19.418
Sally just says so.

7
00:00:19.418 --> 00:00:26.272
Her Team Lead rates it High, because money moves, and tells her exactly where she will be asked to decide.

8
00:00:26.672 --> 00:00:37.271
The Designer writes it up in plain English: a Buy now button, Stripe Checkout, the price always from the catalog, flat-rate shipping, and test mode only.

9
00:00:37.271 --> 00:00:39.280
Sally reads it, and approves.

10
00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:44.665
She sets the mandate: what's in scope, what must never break, and a budget.

11
00:00:44.665 --> 00:00:49.650
The Planner breaks the work into four small steps, each with its own tests.

12
00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:50.248
Approved.

13
00:00:50.648 --> 00:00:51.905
Now the crew works.

14
00:00:51.905 --> 00:00:56.868
Every step adds its own tests, and nothing moves on until all of them pass.

15
00:00:56.868 --> 00:01:00.904
Two hundred forty-three tests became two hundred seventy-six.

16
00:01:01.304 --> 00:01:05.104
The Judge proves the exact candidate and opens a preview.

17
00:01:05.104 --> 00:01:10.637
Sally buys a cordless drill with Stripe's test card, and the order lands in Stripe.

18
00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:12.304
She approves the release.

19
00:01:12.704 --> 00:01:13.365
It's live.

20
00:01:13.365 --> 00:01:21.160
And every decision, every test run and every handoff is on the record: on Sally's timeline, and in her own repository.

21
00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:22.444
Sally sells.

22
00:01:22.444 --> 00:01:23.622
The crew builds.

23
00:01:23.622 --> 00:01:26.348
And nothing ships without her say-so.

24
00:01:26.348 --> 00:01:29.368
The Accelerator, from Strategic Machines.
